Draw its distance–time graph on the grid.

mastery.solution_text:
$d_{1}=60\times1$
$=60\text{ km}$
$d_{2}=80\times1.5$
$=120\text{ km}$
End of stage $1$: $(1\text{ h},\,60\text{ km})$
End of the stop: $(1.5\text{ h},\,60\text{ km})$
End of stage $2$: $(3\text{ h},\,60+120)=(3\text{ h},\,180\text{ km})$
